### 1. Fix the Row Count Bug (Stale State)
**File to update:** JournalBulkUpload.js (or .jsx)
You need to clear the requestId and totalRows variables when a user selects a new file or clicks "Start Validation".
**Change 1: Inside the validateAndSetFile function**
Find this block:
```javascript
    setFile(selected);
    setIsCsvFile(fileName.endsWith(".csv"));
    setResultStatus(null);
    setResultMsg("");
    setValidationStage(0);
    setPreviewRows([]);
    setAutoDlTriggered(false);
    setIsProcessing(false);
    setDownloadMsg("Downloading error report...");

```
**Replace it with:**
```javascript
    setFile(selected);
    setIsCsvFile(fileName.endsWith(".csv"));
    setResultStatus(null);
    setResultMsg("");
    setValidationStage(0);
    setPreviewRows([]);
    setTotalRows(0);        // NEW: Clears old row count
    setRequestId(null);     // NEW: Clears old request ID
    setAutoDlTriggered(false);
    setIsProcessing(false);
    setDownloadMsg("Downloading error report...");

```
**Change 2: Inside the handleStartValidation function**
Find this block:
```javascript
    triggerDebounce();
    setResultStatus(null);
    setResultMsg("");
    setValidationStage(0);
    setIsProcessing(true);
    setAutoDlTriggered(false);
